issue_context.body:
Currently, we don't have any support of connecting to the ADB server running on a different port except 5037. We have our ADB servers running on different ports apart from 5037 and we need to manually change it backendAdb.js in our node_modules folder. 
```  
const socket = new BufferedSocketWrapper(command, net.createConnection({
    port: 5037
  }));
```
Can we accept connectOptions of port in android.devices and create a connection on the provided port and default it to 5037 if nothing is provided?
